{{Quote|For generations, my ancestors fought proudly as warriors against the Jedi. Now, that woman tarnishes the very name Mandalorian. Defend her, if you will.|Pre Vizsla denounces Satine Kryze in front of Obi-Wan Kenobi|audio=AgainstTheJedi-TMP.flac|<ref name="TMP" />}}
The '''fight on Concordia'''<ref name="OSWM">{{GermanFanCite|106|Database}}</ref> was a skirmish that took place on [[Concordia]] during the [[Clone Wars]], resulting in the exposure of [[Concordia]]'s [[Governor]] [[Pre Vizsla]] as the leader of the [[Death Watch]].<ref name="TMP" />

